"In mortal life Efestar was an assassin with poison darts in Emeric's band."
"Efestar's sons, Caeno and Irkal, were burned; the band swore vengeance for them."
"Efestar got no mantle at the ascension, for Enttiku kept death."
"The band made peace with Enttiku without Efestar, and never apologized to him."
"Efestar was once Efestar the Wayfarer, a light god."
"Efestar hints that the gods hide how they gained their powers."
"Efestar offered Viviane his power freely; she refused."
"Efestar learned to love beer from Viviane's memories."
"Efestar hates being called Fefe, as Viviane calls him."
"Efestar knows the golem Solfis as Irlefen's contraption."
